## Monitoring

Open-source monitoring was implemented using Prometheus and Kubernetes Dashboard.

Monitoring Features:
- Cluster health monitoring
- Node status monitoring
- Pod status monitoring
- Service monitoring
- Resource utilization tracking

Tools Used:
- Prometheus
- Kubernetes Dashboard
- kubectl monitoring commands

Commands:

kubectl get nodes
kubectl get pods -A
kubectl get svc -A
note for my task:
Due to resource limitations of the training cluster (t3.micro worker nodes),
some monitoring pods remained in Pending state. The monitoring stack was
successfully deployed and configured using open-source Prometheus components.
